after running ./bagheera_rel_packager.sh release_2_0.sh

copy autocam, config and work(tycho) to package folder
copy bagheera.sh and BAGHEERA.service files to bagheera_service folder
copy install.sh, nohup.out to bin folder
copy log folder to nddevide
copy cloudconfig.ini and command.txt to nddevide/latest


Now you can zip package to release.tar.bz2 and install.sh can install it in DVT1
